  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, award-winning, sheer tinted lip oil that delivers lightweight hydration and non-sticky shine with a cushiony feel.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Gloss, Lip Balm and Treatment</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>>- Vegan Collagen: Moisturizes and maintains suppleness.</p><p>- Prickly Pear Oil: Provides barrier-boosting hydration.</p><p>- Plant Squalane: Nourishes and softens the lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is clean, vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Glide on lips.<br>-Use as often as desired.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Vegan Collagen: Moisturizes and maintains suppleness.<br>-Prickly Pear Oil: Provides barrier-boosting hydration.<br>-Plant Squalane: Nourishes and softens the lips. <br><br>Polybutene, Octyldodecanol, Diisopropyl Sebacate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride,<br>Opuntia Ficus-Indica Seed Oil, Sr-Hydrozoan Polypeptide-1, Portulaca Pilosa<br>Extract, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, Squalane, Sucrose Cocoate, Cetearyl<br>Ethylhexanoate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Ethyl Vanillin, Aqua (Water, Eau), Sebacic<br>Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Potassium Sorbate. May Contain +/-: Ci 45410 (Red 27), Ci<br>17200 (Red 33 Lake), Ci 15850 (Red 6), Ci 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), Ci 45410 (Red 28 Lake), Ci 15985 (Yellow 6 Lake).<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
